// A volunteer's pass for the heartbeat servers: "<user>.<device>.<expiry>.<hmac>", checked by a server without any
// database (it holds HB_SERVER_SECRET too).
// Security review W5: no server holds HB_SERVER_SECRET. Each gets a key derived from it: the heartbeat servers (their
// passes, reports and agent) serverKey("hb"); each workhorse row serverKey("wh:<server_id>") (its agent, its sign-in,
// and the wolves that use the row). A key taken from one server cannot act as another row. Every signed request is
// also accepted only once (oneTime). HB_KEYS_PHASE 1: the old shared secret still accepted while the servers switch.
const HB_KEYS_PHASE = 2;                                  // 2026-10-28 06:10: every server switched to its own key
